---
/** The Autopilot hero screen: one stage, two states, flipped by the
    card's switch. */
---
<div class="mk-panel wide">
  <div class="v v-auto">
    <div class="mk-head"><b>Quotation · Nairobi</b><small>Automation on</small></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Rift Valley Ground Services</b><small>Replied 09:41</small></div><span class="r">€4,180</span></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk now"></span><div><b>Acacia Safari Logistics</b><small>Reminder sent for you</small></div><span class="mk-tag grey">Waiting</span></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Karen Overland → Mara Plains</b><small>Declined · re-routed</small></div><span class="r">€4,505</span></div>
    <span class="mk-fine">You choose. Nothing is booked until you do.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="v v-manual">
    <div class="mk-head"><b>Quotation · Nairobi</b><small>By hand</small></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk hold"></span><div><b>Rift Valley Ground Services</b><small>Emailed Tuesday · no reply</small></div><span class="mk-tag amb">Chase</span></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk wait"></span><div><b>Acacia Safari Logistics</b><small>Not asked yet</small></div><span class="mk-tag amb">To do</span></div>
    <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk hold"></span><div><b>Karen Overland Co.</b><small>Declined · find another</small></div><span class="mk-tag amb">To do</span></div>
    <span class="mk-fine">Every line is yours.</span>
  </div>
</div>
